    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MARJORIE: Well, this is a surprise.\nLEE: You invited me, did you not?\nMARJORIE: You didn’t reply.\nLEE: A coat check? At my party we threw coats on a bed.",
      "MARJORIE: That was quick. Did you get properly fed?\nLEE: This week. Will you take my call?\nMARJORIE: Sure. We’ll see.\nLEE: I have fascinating projects! I’m working on a lot of ideas - I just need my agent to call me back.",
      "RACHEL: You still have a balance, Ms. Israel.\nLEE: But there’s something wrong with her. She’s very old.\nRACHEL: I’m sorry. The doctor told me to get at least half the balance before we do any tests.\nLEE: Don’t you take a Hippocratic oath or something? Don’t you have to do something?",
      "LEE: I would, except it’s an object.\nRACHEL: Jersey Israel?\nRACHEL: Hi, Ms. Israel. Are you’re able to pay for the tests?\nLEE: That’s why I’m here. You shouldn’t de-claw.",
      "LEE: We’re not buying today. Just looking.\nNELL: No problem. I’m asking six hundred."
    ]
  },
